            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2644614?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values-5/#if-notation\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values-5/#if-notation</a></li>\n<li>Chrome\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Intent to ship (136): <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/EOz7NK6Y0cE/m/VsZveC-fAwAJ\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/EOz7NK6Y0cE/m/VsZveC-fAwAJ</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/6313805904347136?gate=5199452060778496\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/6313805904347136?gate=5199452060778496</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/346977961\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://issues.chromium.org/issues/346977961</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Firefox\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Request for position: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2811265814\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/1167\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/1167/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/1167\">mozilla/standards-positions#1167</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Safari\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Request for position: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2811263262\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/453\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/453/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/453\">WebKit/standards-positions#453</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
